<h1>Used SUVs and Crossovers for Sale in Carroll, IA</h1>

<p>This page lists the used SUVs and crossovers at Motor Inn Auto Group, 1526 Le Clark Road in Carroll, Iowa. Open any vehicle card for that unit&#x27;s listed price and details, or call 712-792-5000 and tell us how many seats and how much cargo room you need.</p>

<h2>Which used SUV size fits your household?</h2>

<p>Match the SUV to what it carries most days. Compact crossovers handle commuting and tight parking. Midsize SUVs add second-row room for kids and gear. Three-row SUVs carry six to eight people, and the largest ones are the ones shoppers look at for towing campers or boats on weekend trips.</p>

<p>Once you know the size, open the listings in that class above and compare the seating, cargo and feature details on each vehicle page.</p>

<h2>Are there hybrid or all-wheel-drive used SUVs in stock?</h2>

<p>Check the list above for the driveline you want - it shows the units on the lot today. Two used SUVs that drew the most site views the week of November 9-15, 2026 were a <a href="/used-Carroll-2017-Toyota-RAV4+Hybrid-XLE-JTMRJREV6HD099831">2017 Toyota RAV4 Hybrid XLE</a> and a <a href="/used-Carroll-2024-Toyota-Grand+Highlander-Hybrid+MAX+Platinum-5TDADAB57RS001101">2024 Toyota Grand Highlander Hybrid MAX Platinum</a>. Iowa winters make all-wheel drive a common request, so call if you want help finding one.</p>

<h2>What should I check on a used SUV before I buy?</h2>

<p>Ask four things about the exact unit: its mileage and service records, its vehicle history report, how the tires and brakes measure, and the full price in writing. The price shown on our vehicle pages includes the $180 doc fee, so the number you see is the number you start from.</p>

<p>That short list works at any dealership. If a seller cannot answer the history or the full price directly, that tells you something too.</p>

<h2>How do I line up a test drive?</h2>

<p>Choose the SUV from the list, then <a href="/testdrive.aspx?type=Used">schedule a used-SUV test drive</a> or call Motor Inn Auto Group at 712-792-5000 and name the vehicle. Still deciding between sizes? Say so, and ask to drive two back to back - a used one, or a used one next to a <a href="/new-suvs">new SUV</a> if you want that comparison.</p>

<h2>What if my budget has a firm ceiling?</h2>

<p>Start with the <a href="/under-20000">vehicles under $20,000</a> list and the <a href="/paymentcalc.aspx">payment calculator</a>, then call 712-792-5000 about a monthly range for a specific unit. Your current vehicle can be part of that number; the <a href="/trade.aspx">trade-in page</a> explains how trade figures work here.</p>
